OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet and
OL,6,Fcold evening with rain, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes, and some sleet over the hills.
OL,8,FRemaining damp overnight but rain
OL,9,Fturning lighter for most. Gusty winds
OL,10,Fwill gradually ease, though remaining
OL,11,Fbreezy along the coast and over the
OL,12,Fhills.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FAn overcast day with patchy
OL,15,Frain across the region. Rain will be
OL,16,Fmostly drizzly but the odd heavier
OL,17,Fburst is possible. Light winds and
OL,18,Ffeeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
