OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clears to leave a drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter end to Thursday. Largely dry
OL,8,FFriday and Saturday but a chance of
OL,9,Fcoastal showers. Temperatures below
OL,10,Fnormal. Mostly light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
